{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cosmic Castaway",
    "steam_appid": 3694870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/extras/42d48a996dd6b69af12db2aeb6576666.avif?t=1755240200\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the galaxy\u2019s unluckiest starship captain.</strong><br>Crash-land on strange planets, gather scarce resources, and rescue your stranded crew. Each successful evacuation earns you stars \u2014 collect enough and you\u2019ll unlock new worlds to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your crash-landings won\u2019t curb your thirst for adventure.</strong><br>Build thriving colonies to shelter your crew, repair your ship, and defend against the hostile lifeforms of alien worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/extras/f5fed3e0feb3b75eda507fde7861a2db.avif?t=1755240200\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Food is a must if we want to survive and we are running against the clock. Buildings and objects are all crafted from the 4 key resources; Lumber, Stone, Food, &amp; Ore. How those resources are utilized will play a key role in your eventual success or demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also have to manage an electric grid system to power non manned defenses and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/extras/02825ab8318287932ad3a06c57cc2243.avif?t=1755240200\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infrastructure Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sawmills, mines, fishing docks, farms, windmills, boardings, bridges, defense turrets, and more. Strategically placed resource infrastructure will yield results longer. Improperly placed/manned defenses could see the collapse of your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend the colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space engineers don\u2019t have much training in battle. Luckily for you, your robot sentry drone is up to the task! However, as the colony grows, you will require more advanced defense systems. Strategically place these defensive systems to protect what you built and to advance further in your quest to rebuild your starship and blast off to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From wreckage to refuge. With your crew, forge the way home.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/extras/42d48a996dd6b69af12db2aeb6576666.avif?t=1755240200\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the galaxy\u2019s unluckiest starship captain.</strong><br>Crash-land on strange planets, gather scarce resources, and rescue your stranded crew. Each successful evacuation earns you stars \u2014 collect enough and you\u2019ll unlock new worlds to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your crash-landings won\u2019t curb your thirst for adventure.</strong><br>Build thriving colonies to shelter your crew, repair your ship, and defend against the hostile lifeforms of alien worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/extras/f5fed3e0feb3b75eda507fde7861a2db.avif?t=1755240200\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think fast. Food is a must if we want to survive and we are running against the clock. Buildings and objects are all crafted from the 4 key resources; Lumber, Stone, Food, &amp; Ore. How those resources are utilized will play a key role in your eventual success or demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also have to manage an electric grid system to power non manned defenses and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/extras/02825ab8318287932ad3a06c57cc2243.avif?t=1755240200\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infrastructure Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sawmills, mines, fishing docks, farms, windmills, boardings, bridges, defense turrets, and more. Strategically placed resource infrastructure will yield results longer. Improperly placed/manned defenses could see the collapse of your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend the colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space engineers don\u2019t have much training in battle. Luckily for you, your robot sentry drone is up to the task! However, as the colony grows, you will require more advanced defense systems. Strategically place these defensive systems to protect what you built and to advance further in your quest to rebuild your starship and blast off to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From wreckage to refuge. With your crew, forge the way home.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cosmic Castaway is a colony building survival game. Gather scarce resources, rescue and assign your crew, build and defend your outpost from hostile forces, and turn wreckage into refuge to repair your ship and escape back to your home planet.",
